# Secrets: API keys and provider credentials live here.
#
# `.env.*` as well as `.env`, so a `.env.local` or `.env.production` cannot be
# added by accident. `.env.example` is re-included: it holds no values, only the
# list of variable names and what each one does, and it is the file somebody
# reads to set up a deployment.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local runtime state — the tracker ledger is machine-local state, not source.
data/
.venv/
.share/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/sec_facts/

# Screen recordings and other captures. Not source, and an 8.5MB video in the
# repo is 8.5MB every clone and every deploy build pays for.
*.MP4
*.mp4
*.mov
